<title>UK: London gold fixed firmer in PM, silver off lows.</title>
<headline>London gold fixed firmer in PM, silver off lows.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixes firmer at $320.80 versus $317.60 AM. Bounces on fund profit-taking. But resistance seen around $322.00.</p>
<p>SILVER - Comes off lows with gold. But still sharply lower compared to Tuesday, at $4.33/$4.35.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Weaker at $404.00/$407.00, down $6.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Off $6.70 at $175.00/$179.00.</p>
</text>
